---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import {
  SITE_URL, COMPANY, CONTACT_EMAIL, FOUNDER, ORG_ID, GRIEVANCE_PATH, SEBI_SCORES_URL, SMART_ODR_URL,
} from '../lib/site.js'

const description =
  'How to raise a complaint with Nuberry, how long we take to respond, and how to escalate to the fund house, SEBI SCORES and SMART ODR.'
// Change this date whenever the process changes.
const lastUpdated = '2026-11-06'
const jsonLd = [{
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'WebPage',
  name: 'Investor grievance redressal',
  url: `${SITE_URL}${GRIEVANCE_PATH}`,
  dateModified: lastUpdated,
  about: { '@id': ORG_ID },
  publisher: { '@id': ORG_ID },
}]
---
<Base
  title="Investor Grievance Redressal: How to Complain | Nuberry"
  description={description}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Investor grievances', path: GRIEVANCE_PATH }]}
>
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">How we work</span>
    <h1 class="display">Investor grievance redressal</h1>
    <p class="lede">Who to contact if something goes wrong, how long we take, and where to go if you're not satisfied.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap legal">
    <div class="prose">
      <p><time datetime={lastUpdated}>Last updated 6 November 2026</time></p>

      <h2>Level 1: contact Nuberry</h2>
      <p>
        Our grievance officer is {FOUNDER.name}, {FOUNDER.role}. Write to
        <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Please include your name, your child's name as on the folio, the folio number if
        you have it, and what went wrong.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>We acknowledge every complaint within 2 working days.</li>
        <li>We aim to resolve it within 21 days of receiving it, and tell you the outcome in writing.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Level 2: the fund house</h2>
      <p>
        If your complaint is about a transaction, a statement, a redemption or the folio itself, you can also write to the
        investor service desk of the fund house (AMC) that manages the scheme. Its contact details are on your account
        statement and on the fund house's website. Fund houses are responsible for the distributors who sell their schemes.
      </p>

      <h2>Level 3: SEBI SCORES</h2>
      <p>
        If you are not satisfied with the response, or have not had one within 21 days, you can lodge a complaint against
        the fund house on <a href={SEBI_SCORES_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SEBI SCORES</a>, the
        regulator's online complaints system.
      </p>

      <h2>Level 4: SMART ODR</h2>
      <p>
        If a complaint is still unresolved, you can start online conciliation and arbitration through the
        <a href={SMART_ODR_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SMART ODR portal</a>, set up by SEBI for disputes
        with market participants.
      </p>

      <h2>About us</h2>
      <p>
        Nuberry is a brand of {COMPANY.legalName} (CIN {COMPANY.cin}), an AMFI-registered mutual fund distributor, ARN
        {COMPANY.arn}. Registered office: {COMPANY.address}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
